<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- NagramX: fork-owned scissors glyph for the composer toolbar. There is no upstream twin to track,
     so this file is the raw artwork. It carries no group transform on purpose: the row's optical
     correction is a uniform scale, which under the toolbar's FIT_CENTER icon box is mathematically
     the same whether it is baked here or applied at runtime, so it lives in one reviewable table in
     ComposerButtons instead of being spread across the assets. Bake a group here only to *move* ink,
     which a scale cannot do. Measured raw: 16.05% ink, bounding box 70.90 x 73.05% of the canvas. -->
